  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Building Municipal Capacities for Project Implementation &#x2013; Phase 2</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">As the impact of the multiple global crises at the country level accelerates, funds are being increasingly required to tackle complex, cross-sector, cross scale challenges needing rapid transformative change that will bring desired and durable impact at local level. The continuation of Building Municipal Capacities for Project Implementation - BMCPI (Phase 2) will allow for scaled and transformative impact by integrating elements of institutional sustainability, good governance and environmental</narrative>
  </description>
